<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Hear the bleeding Savior crying,</l><l>“It is done.”</l><l>Claim His finished work, replying,</l><l>“It is done.”</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Yield thyself in consecration,</l><l>“It is done.”</l><l>Take the Lord for full salvation,</l><l>“It is done.”</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>Claim the promise of His healing,</l><l>“It is done.”</l><l>Trust without a sign or feeling,</l><l>“It is done.”</l></lg>
<lg label="5."><l>Say of every promised blessing,</l><l>“It is done.”</l><l>Rest upon His word, confessing,</l><l>“It is done.”</l></lg>
<lg label="6."><l>This the secret of receiving,</l><l>“It is done.”</l><l>Take Him at His word believing,</l><l>“It is done.”</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
